//- #1173: the fourteen per-source links that were here are the import PAGE now
  - one full-width page that lists every source, offers the same "what to
  include" checkboxes every export offers, and keeps its own address per source
  so the old links still work. What is left in the popup is the one import that
  is not a board: card dependencies.
template(name="chooseBoardSourcePopup")
