    li
      //- "Import board", and nothing else. It used to read "Import board
        (Trello, Jira, WeKan export, CSV, Excel, ...)" - the whole list of
        sources, in a menu row, above a page that asks which source it is and
        lists every one of them with room to. Naming them twice makes the menu
        the thing to read and the page the thing to confirm.
        client/components/import/import.jade
      a.js-open-import-page(href="{{pathFor '/import'}}")
        i.fa.fa-download
